    "# 3. Backtest Performance\n",
    "\n",
    "We evaluate the CPI MoM surprise-based t+1 strategy on SPY and QQQ.\n",
    "\n",
    "For each asset (SPY / QQQ) and each sample window, we report:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Annualized mean return\n",
    "- Annualized volatility\n",
    "- Sharpe ratio\n",
    "- Cumulative return\n",
    "- Number of observations\n",
    "\n",
    "We compare the **strategy** against a **buy-and-hold benchmark**.\n",
    "\n",
    "We consider:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Full sample  \n",
    "- 2004\u20132019 (pre-COVID)  \n",
    "- 2020\u20132024 (post-COVID)\n"
   ]
